<Container ElementId="expert-support" Padding="Padding.Is5.OnY">
    <Heading Size="HeadingSize.Is2" TextWeight="TextWeight.Bold" Margin="Margin.Is3.FromBottom">
        Live help from a Blazorise expert
    </Heading>

    <Lead TextColor="TextColor.Muted">
        Get direct access to a Blazorise expert for live troubleshooting, code review, and implementation guidance. Choose a level based on how quickly you need access to an expert, not the technical complexity of the issue.
    </Lead>

    <Row Gutter="Gutter.Is4" Margin="Margin.Is4.FromTop.Is4.FromBottom">
        <Column ColumnSize="ColumnSize.Is12.Is6.OnDesktop" Margin="Margin.Is4.FromBottom">
            <Card Border="Border.Rounded" Shadow="Shadow.Small" Height="Height.Is100">
                <CardBody Padding="Padding.Is4.Is5.OnDesktop" Display="Display.Flex" Flex="Flex.Column">
                    <Div Margin="Margin.Is3.FromBottom">
                        <Badge Color="Color.Secondary" Subtle Pill Padding="Padding.Is2.OnY.Is3.OnX">Scheduled session</Badge>
                    </Div>
                    <Heading Size="HeadingSize.Is3" TextSize="TextSize.Heading4" TextWeight="TextWeight.SemiBold" Margin="Margin.Is3.FromBottom">
                        Live Expert Support
                    </Heading>
                    <Paragraph Margin="Margin.Is3.FromBottom">
                        <Span TextSize="TextSize.Heading2" TextWeight="TextWeight.Bold">€150</Span>
                        <Span TextColor="TextColor.Muted" TextSize="TextSize.Large"> / hour</Span>
                    </Paragraph>
                    <Paragraph TextColor="TextColor.Muted" Margin="Margin.Is4.FromBottom">
                        Work through a technical challenge with a Blazorise expert over a Microsoft Teams call with screen sharing.
                    </Paragraph>
                    <Div Flex="Flex.Column" Gap="Gap.Is3" Margin="Margin.Is4.FromBottom">
                        <Div Flex="Flex.AlignItems.Start" Gap="Gap.Is3">
                            <Icon Name="IconName.Check" TextColor="TextColor.Primary" Margin="Margin.Is1.FromTop" />
                            <Span>Troubleshooting, code review, and configuration</Span>
                        </Div>
                        <Div Flex="Flex.AlignItems.Start" Gap="Gap.Is3">
                            <Icon Name="IconName.Check" TextColor="TextColor.Primary" Margin="Margin.Is1.FromTop" />
                            <Span>Migration assistance and implementation guidance</Span>
                        </Div>
                        <Div Flex="Flex.AlignItems.Start" Gap="Gap.Is3">
                            <Icon Name="IconName.Check" TextColor="TextColor.Primary" Margin="Margin.Is1.FromTop" />
                            <Span>Testing small code changes during the session</Span>
                        </Div>
                    </Div>
                    <Div Margin="Margin.IsAuto.FromTop" Padding="Padding.Is3.FromTop">
                        <Paragraph TextWeight="TextWeight.SemiBold" Margin="Margin.Is1.FromBottom">1-hour minimum</Paragraph>
                        <Paragraph TextColor="TextColor.Muted" TextSize="TextSize.Small" Margin="Margin.Is4.FromBottom">
                            Additional time billed in 30-minute increments.<br />
                            Scheduled based on normal expert availability.
                        </Paragraph>
                        <Button Type="ButtonType.Link" To="custom-work/quote" Color="Color.Primary" Size="Size.Large" Outline Block>
                            Request a session
                        </Button>
                    </Div>
                </CardBody>
            </Card>
        </Column>
        <Column ColumnSize="ColumnSize.Is12.Is6.OnDesktop" Margin="Margin.Is4.FromBottom">
            <Card Border="Border.Rounded" Shadow="Shadow.Small" Height="Height.Is100">
                <CardBody Padding="Padding.Is4.Is5.OnDesktop" Display="Display.Flex" Flex="Flex.Column">
                    <Div Margin="Margin.Is3.FromBottom">
                        <Badge Color="Color.Primary" Subtle Pill Padding="Padding.Is2.OnY.Is3.OnX">Priority scheduling</Badge>
                    </Div>
                    <Heading Size="HeadingSize.Is3" TextSize="TextSize.Heading4" TextWeight="TextWeight.SemiBold" Margin="Margin.Is3.FromBottom">
                        Priority Expert Support
                    </Heading>
                    <Paragraph Margin="Margin.Is3.FromBottom">
                        <Span TextSize="TextSize.Heading2" TextWeight="TextWeight.Bold">€200</Span>
                        <Span TextColor="TextColor.Muted" TextSize="TextSize.Large"> / hour</Span>
                    </Paragraph>
                    <Paragraph TextColor="TextColor.Muted" Margin="Margin.Is4.FromBottom">
                        Get expedited access to a Blazorise expert when an issue is blocking your team or a deadline is approaching.
                    </Paragraph>
                    <Div Flex="Flex.Column" Gap="Gap.Is3" Margin="Margin.Is4.FromBottom">
                        <Div Flex="Flex.AlignItems.Start" Gap="Gap.Is3">
                            <Icon Name="IconName.Check" TextColor="TextColor.Primary" Margin="Margin.Is1.FromTop" />
                            <Span>Everything included with Live Expert Support</Span>
                        </Div>
                        <Div Flex="Flex.AlignItems.Start" Gap="Gap.Is3">
                            <Icon Name="IconName.Check" TextColor="TextColor.Primary" Margin="Margin.Is1.FromTop" />
                            <Span>Priority scheduling for blocking issues, releases, and migration deadlines</Span>
                        </Div>
                        <Div Flex="Flex.AlignItems.Start" Gap="Gap.Is3">
                            <Icon Name="IconName.Check" TextColor="TextColor.Primary" Margin="Margin.Is1.FromTop" />
                            <Span>Same-business-day or next-available-slot target, where possible</Span>
                        </Div>
                    </Div>
                    <Div Margin="Margin.IsAuto.FromTop" Padding="Padding.Is3.FromTop">
                        <Paragraph TextWeight="TextWeight.SemiBold" Margin="Margin.Is1.FromBottom">1-hour minimum</Paragraph>
                        <Paragraph TextColor="TextColor.Muted" TextSize="TextSize.Small" Margin="Margin.Is4.FromBottom">
                            Additional time billed in 30-minute increments.<br />
                            Priority scheduling, subject to expert availability.
                        </Paragraph>
                        <Button Type="ButtonType.Link" To="custom-work/quote" Color="Color.Primary" Size="Size.Large" Block>
                            Request priority support
                        </Button>
                    </Div>
                </CardBody>
            </Card>
        </Column>
    </Row>

    <Card Border="Border.Rounded" Margin="Margin.Is4.FromBottom">
        <CardBody Padding="Padding.Is4" Display="Display.Flex" Flex="Flex.Column" Gap="Gap.Is2">
            <Heading Size="HeadingSize.Is3" TextSize="TextSize.Heading4" TextWeight="TextWeight.SemiBold" Margin="Margin.Is0">
                Emergency Expert Support
            </Heading>
            <Paragraph TextSize="TextSize.Heading4" TextWeight="TextWeight.Bold" Margin="Margin.Is0">
                From €250 / hour
            </Paragraph>
            <Paragraph Margin="Margin.Is0">
                Available for production-critical problems, blocked deployments, critical release issues, or other time-sensitive situations. Evening, weekend, and other out-of-hours requests may have a higher rate.
            </Paragraph>
            <Paragraph TextColor="TextColor.Muted" Margin="Margin.Is0">
                1-hour minimum. Pricing varies depending on timing and circumstances. Assistance is subject to expert availability, with no guaranteed availability unless separately agreed.
            </Paragraph>
            <Div>
                <Button Type="ButtonType.Link" To="custom-work/quote" Color="Color.Light">
                    Ask about availability
                </Button>
            </Div>
        </CardBody>
    </Card>

    <Card Border="Border.Rounded" Background="Background.Light">
        <CardBody Padding="Padding.Is4">
            <Heading Size="HeadingSize.Is3" TextSize="TextSize.Heading4" TextWeight="TextWeight.SemiBold">Before you book</Heading>
            <Paragraph TextColor="TextColor.Muted">
                Priority and Emergency scheduling targets are subject to expert availability and are not guaranteed SLAs unless separately agreed.
            </Paragraph>

            <Paragraph TextColor="TextColor.Muted">
                These services do not replace commercial license support. Standard product questions, bug reports, and asynchronous technical support remain available through the normal support channel covered by the applicable license. Expert Support is an optional service for customers who specifically want hands-on, synchronous assistance.
            </Paragraph>

            <Paragraph TextColor="TextColor.Muted">
                Small changes and experiments performed during a session are included in the session time. Substantial implementation, framework modification, feature development, or extended investigation is estimated separately as Custom Development, Expert on Demand, Feature Sponsorship, or another appropriate service.
            </Paragraph>

            <Paragraph TextColor="TextColor.Muted">
                <Strong>Enterprise Plus customers</Strong> can use their included Expert on Demand hours for eligible Live Expert Support sessions. Priority or Emergency scheduling may require an additional fee, even when included hours are available.
            </Paragraph>
        </CardBody>
    </Card>
</Container>